---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
import profileImage from '../../assets/profiled.jpg'
---

<Layout title="Biography | Daniel Vieira Teixeira">
    <main class="biography">
        <header class="page-hero">
            <p class="page-meta">B / 01 · Cape Town, South Africa</p>
            <h1>
                Engineer by trade.<br /><em>Problem solver by instinct.</em>
            </h1>
            <figure class="portrait-card">
                <img
                    src={profileImage.src}
                    alt="Portrait of Daniel Vieira Teixeira"
                    loading="eager"
                    decoding="async"
                />
                <figcaption>
                    <strong>Daniel Vieira Teixeira</strong><span
                        >Full Stack Software Engineer</span
                    >
                </figcaption>
            </figure>
            <p class="lede">
                I work across frontend, backend, and quality because real
                product problems rarely respect those boundaries.
            </p>
        </header>

        <section class="story" aria-labelledby="story-title">
            <h2 id="story-title">A wider view of the system.</h2>
            <div class="story-copy">
                <p>
                    I'm Daniel Vieira Teixeira, a full-stack software engineer
                    with more than five years of experience building SaaS
                    products in fast-moving, client-facing teams.
                </p>
                <p>
                    My foundation is TypeScript. My value is range: responsive
                    React interfaces, backend integrations, real-time features,
                    automated testing, CI quality gates, observability, and the
                    production work that keeps a useful product useful.
                </p>
                <p>
                    I like assignments where the brief is still tangled. I
                    clarify the constraint, find the layer with the most
                    leverage, and move between disciplines until the system
                    behaves better for the people who depend on it.
                </p>
            </div>
            <p class="margin-note">
                Five+ years<br />SaaS delivery<br />One connected view
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="modes" aria-labelledby="modes-title">
            <header>
                <h2 id="modes-title">Four modes.<br />No silos.</h2>
            </header>
            <div class="mode-grid">
                <article>
                    <p>01 / Frontend</p><h3>Make complexity legible.</h3><ul>
                        <li>React and TypeScript</li><li>
                            Responsive product interfaces
                        </li><li>Data visualisation</li><li>
                            Realtime WebSocket features
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </article>
                <article>
                    <p>02 / Backend</p><h3>
                        Make the hand-offs dependable.
                    </h3><ul>
                        <li>Node.js and REST services</li><li>
                            API and database integrations
                        </li><li>Event-driven features</li><li>
                            Workflow automation
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </article>
                <article>
                    <p>03 / Quality</p><h3>Make confidence repeatable.</h3><ul>
                        <li>Playwright automation</li><li>
                            Manual regression testing
                        </li><li>GitHub Actions quality gates</li><li>
                            Failure artifacts and reporting
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </article>
                <article>
                    <p>04 / Reliability</p><h3>
                        Make production understandable.
                    </h3><ul>
                        <li>Sentry and exception triage</li><li>
                            Uptime and service monitoring
                        </li><li>Docker workflows</li><li>
                            Security and maintenance
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="principles" aria-labelledby="principles-title">
            <h2 id="principles-title">
                The code matters.<br /><em>So does the context.</em>
            </h2>
            <ol>
                <li>
                    <span>01</span><p>
                        Ask what success changes for the user and the business.
                    </p>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <span>02</span><p>
                        Respect the codebase and constraints already in the
                        room.
                    </p>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <span>03</span><p>
                        Prefer visible feedback loops over invisible
                        assumptions.
                    </p>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <span>04</span><p>
                        Leave the system easier for the next person to reason
                        about.
                    </p>
                </li>
            </ol>
        </section>

        <footer class="page-cta">
            <p>Have a complicated product problem?</p>
            <a href="/contact"
                >Let's untangle it <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a
            >
        </footer>
    </main>
</Layout>

<style lang="scss">
    .biography {
        background: var(--paper);
    }
    .page-meta,
    .section-code {
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        font-variation-settings:
            'wdth' 76,
            'wght' 650;
        letter-spacing: 0.16em;
        line-height: 1.3;
        text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .page-hero {
        position: relative;
        min-height: 78svh;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.35fr 0.65fr;
        gap: 3rem;
        align-content: space-between;
        padding: var(--page-gutter);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
    }
    .page-meta {
        position: absolute;
        top: var(--page-gutter);
        left: var(--page-gutter);
    }

    .page-hero h1 {
        grid-column: 1 / -1;
        margin-top: clamp(5rem, 11vh, 8rem);
        font-size: clamp(4.5rem, 9.4vw, 10.5rem);
        font-variation-settings:
            'wdth' 77,
            'wght' 330;
        letter-spacing: -0.055em;
        line-height: 0.8;
    }
    .page-hero h1 em {
        color: var(--signal);
        font-weight: 780;
    }
    .lede {
        max-width: 34ch;
        justify-self: end;
        font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 1.8vw, 1.8rem);
        font-variation-settings:
            'wdth' 83,
            'wght' 360;
        line-height: 1.32;
    }
    .index {
        align-self: end;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.68rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.15em;
        text-align: right;
    }
    .story {
        position: relative;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 0.65fr 1fr 0.35fr;
        gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 7rem);
        padding: clamp(6rem, 12vw, 12rem) var(--page-gutter);
    }
    .story h2 {
        max-width: 9ch;
        font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4.5vw, 5rem);
        font-variation-settings:
            'wdth' 72,
            'wght' 560;
        letter-spacing: -0.035em;
        line-height: 0.93;
    }
    .story-copy {
        display: grid;
        gap: 2rem;
    }
    .story-copy p {
        max-width: 43ch;
        font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 1.75vw, 1.75rem);
        font-variation-settings:
            'wdth' 85,
            'wght' 350;
        line-height: 1.45;
    }
    .story-copy p:first-child::first-letter {
        float: left;
        margin: -0.12em 0.12em 0 0;
        color: var(--signal);
        font-size: 5.2em;
        font-variation-settings:
            'wdth' 70,
            'wght' 800;
        line-height: 0.86;
    }
    .margin-note {
        align-self: end;
        padding-left: 1rem;
        border-left: 1px solid var(--rule);
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.68rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
        line-height: 1.65;
        text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .modes {
        padding: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 10rem) var(--page-gutter);
        color: var(--paper);
        background: var(--ink);
    }
    .modes > header {
        display: block;
        align-items: end;
        margin-bottom: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 8rem);
    }
    .modes h2 {
        margin-left: 38%;
    }
    .modes h2,
    .principles h2 {
        font-size: clamp(4rem, 7.5vw, 8.5rem);
        font-variation-settings:
            'wdth' 75,
            'wght' 330;
        letter-spacing: -0.05em;
        line-height: 0.82;
    }
    .mode-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        border-top: 1px solid #575755;
        border-left: 1px solid #575755;
    }
    .mode-grid article {
        min-height: 27rem;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 3rem);
        border-right: 1px solid #575755;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #575755;
        transition:
            background 420ms var(--ease-out),
            color 420ms var(--ease-out);
    }
    .mode-grid article:hover {
        color: var(--ink);
        background: var(--signal);
    }
    .mode-grid article > p {
        color: #aaa9a5;
        font-size: 0.68rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.15em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .mode-grid article:hover > p {
        color: var(--ink);
    }
    .mode-grid h3 {
        max-width: 12ch;
        margin: auto 0 2.5rem;
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.6vw, 4.2rem);
        font-variation-settings:
            'wdth' 77,
            'wght' 490;
        line-height: 0.96;
    }
    .mode-grid ul {
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.45rem;
        padding: 0;
        list-style: none;
        color: #b8b8b4;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-variation-settings:
            'wdth' 82,
            'wght' 390;
    }
    .mode-grid article:hover ul {
        color: var(--ink);
    }
    .principles {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 0.45fr 1fr;
        gap: 2rem;
        padding: clamp(6rem, 12vw, 12rem) var(--page-gutter);
    }
    .principles h2 {
        grid-column: 2;
        max-width: 12ch;
        margin: 3rem 0 clamp(5rem, 10vw, 10rem);
    }
    .principles h2 em {
        color: var(--signal);
        font-weight: 760;
    }
    .principles > .section-code {
        grid-column: 1;
        grid-row: 1;
        align-self: start;
    }
    .principles ol {
        grid-column: 2;
        width: min(65rem, 100%);
        margin-left: auto;
        padding: 0;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);
        list-style: none;
    }
    .principles li {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 4rem 1fr;
        gap: 2rem;
        padding: 2rem 0 3rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    }
    .principles li span {
        color: var(--signal);
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    }
    .principles li p {
        max-width: 33ch;
        font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.7vw, 3rem);
        font-variation-settings:
            'wdth' 80,
            'wght' 410;
        line-height: 1.08;
    }
    .page-cta {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 0.6fr 1fr;
        gap: 2rem;
        align-items: end;
        padding: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6rem) var(--page-gutter);
        border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);
    }
    .page-cta p {
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .page-cta a {
        min-height: var(--touch-target);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        padding-bottom: 0.8rem;
        color: var(--signal);
        border-bottom: 3px solid currentcolor;
        font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.5rem);
        font-variation-settings:
            'wdth' 80,
            'wght' 660;
        text-decoration: none;
        text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    @media (max-width: 760px) {
        .page-hero {
            min-height: 58svh;
        }

        .page-hero h1 {
            margin-top: 3rem;
        }

        .page-hero {
            min-height: 62svh;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
        .page-hero h1 {
            grid-column: 1;
            font-size: clamp(4rem, 18vw, 7rem);
        }
        .lede {
            justify-self: start;
        }
        .index {
            display: none;
        }
        .story {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
        .margin-note {
            display: none;
        }
        .modes > header,
        .page-cta {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
        .modes h2 {
            margin-left: 0;
        }
        .mode-grid {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
        .mode-grid article {
            min-height: 23rem;
        }
        .principles {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
        .principles h2,
        .principles ol,
        .principles > .section-code {
            grid-column: 1;
        }
        .principles h2,
        .modes h2 {
            font-size: clamp(3.8rem, 16vw, 6rem);
        }
    }

    /* The biography carries the strongest memory of the original portrait-led site. */
    .page-hero {
        color: var(--heritage-cream);
        border-color: var(--heritage-amber);
        background-color: var(--heritage-charcoal);
        background-image: var(--heritage-texture);
        background-position: center;
        background-size: cover;
        background-blend-mode: soft-light;
    }

    .page-meta {
        color: var(--heritage-cream);
    }

    .page-hero h1 {
        color: var(--heritage-cream);
        letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }

    .page-hero h1 em {
        color: var(--heritage-amber);
        font-family: var(--font-human);
        font-weight: 680;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .portrait-card {
        display: flex;
        gap: 1.5rem;
        align-items: flex-end;
        align-self: end;
    }

    .portrait-card img {
        width: clamp(8rem, 12vw, 11.5rem);
        aspect-ratio: 1;
        border: 4px solid var(--heritage-cream);
        border-radius: 50%;
        outline: 1px solid var(--heritage-amber);
        object-fit: cover;
        filter: grayscale(1) contrast(1.06);
        box-shadow: 7px 7px 0 var(--heritage-amber);
    }

    .portrait-card figcaption {
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.25rem;
        padding-bottom: 0.3rem;
        font-family: var(--font-human);
    }

    .portrait-card strong {
        font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 1.55vw, 1.55rem);
        line-height: 1;
    }
    .portrait-card span {
        color: var(--heritage-amber);
        font-family: var(--font-body);
        font-size: 0.65rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .story {
        background: var(--heritage-cream);
    }
    .story h2 {
        font-family: var(--font-human);
        font-weight: 670;
    }
    .story-copy p:first-child::first-letter {
        color: var(--heritage-amber-ink);
    }

    .modes {
        background-color: var(--heritage-charcoal);
        background-image: var(--heritage-texture);
        background-position: center;
        background-size: cover;
        background-blend-mode: soft-light;
    }

    .principles h2 em {
        color: var(--heritage-amber-ink);
        font-family: var(--font-human);
        font-weight: 680;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .page-cta {
        border-color: var(--ink);
        background: var(--heritage-amber);
    }

    .page-cta a {
        color: var(--ink);
    }

    @media (max-width: 760px) {
        .page-hero {
            min-height: auto;
            padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
        }
        .portrait-card {
            margin: 1rem 0 2rem;
        }
        .portrait-card img {
            width: 6.75rem;
            box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 var(--heritage-amber);
        }
        .portrait-card figcaption {
            max-width: 10rem;
        }
    }
</style>
